{"ts": "2026-10-02T12:00:00+00:00", "module": "B5 vol-managed long (v1 book replaced)", "window": "none (pre-declaration, written before any B5 run)", "change": "user request 2026-10-02: drop news, analyst ratings and insider filings; hold full when vol is low, cut when vol rises, add back when it falls. User choices: universe = the 10 v1 names equal weight; LLM decides within the rule's caps; continuous rule. This is a change of book (long-only, ~100% gross) and not a tuning of v1: v1's beta-neutral test numbers are not the comparison.", "rule": "cap_i(t) = 0.10 * min(1, vt_i(t) / vol7_i(t)); vol7 = features._ticker_state vol_7d (stdev of hourly log returns over the last 7 days, x sqrt 24); vt_i = median of vol7_i sampled at each 00:00 UTC over the trailing 60 days (point-in-time), min 20 samples else cap 0.10; missing vol7 -> cap 0", "risk_v2": "clip every target to [0, cap_i] only; invalid LLM reply -> hold the current book clipped to the caps. Dropped from v1 risk: beta neutralisation, net cap 0.30, per-name 0.15 cap, off-hours 0.5 scale, vol-scaled stop and cooldown, daily kill, funding block", "execution": "decisions at UTC 00/04/08/12/16/20 as v1; sentiment.sim.SimBroker unchanged (next bar open, quoted half spread, taker 6 bp, funding booked where data exists = from 2026-06-22; no-churn band max(0.25% equity, 25% of target))", "variants": {"rule": "target = cap (no LLM)", "llm": "Qwen (config model) sees per-name returns, vol_7d, vol target, cap, funding, premium, book and market line; picks weights in [0, cap]; prompt b5/prompts/decide.md, no evidence cards", "const": "every name at 0.10 x (rule's mean gross exposure in the same window / 1.0), i.e. exposure-matched, no vol management", "buyhold": "every name at 0.10 (full, no vol management)"}, "windows": {"dev": "2026-06-22..08-10 (snapshot)", "test": "2026-08-11..09-22 (snapshot)", "post": "2026-09-23..10-01 (raw)", "long_rule_only": "2025-11-01..2026-10-01 (raw; funding not booked before 2026-06-22, so long-book costs are understated there)"}, "daily_check": "stock daily adjusted closes (yfinance) 2021-01-01..2026-10-01, the 10 names equal weight among names listed that day, w_i = (1/N) * min(1, median(sd10 over trailing 60 trading days) / sd10), sd10 = stdev of the last 10 daily returns; held close(d)->close(d+1); 13 bp per unit turnover; benchmarks equal-weight daily-rebalanced and exposure-matched constant", "pass": "rule Sharpe above const (exposure-matched) with a 95% block-bootstrap CI (5-day blocks on daily returns; 20-day for the daily check) excluding 0, in test AND long_rule_only AND daily_check; otherwise not claimed. LLM increment = llm - rule Sharpe with the same CI; not claimed if it includes 0. Each run once, no grid."}
